6391afbcd5202a68dce818c5_viaduct-harbour-directory%402x.jpg" alt="Thumb Image" class="image_ht"/></div><div class="right_collection_text"><h2 class="text_heading green_text">DIRECTORY</h2><div data-w-id="6195585c-ad6b-2643-1412-a98ed8767e4b" style="opacity:0" class="home_filter_button green_text">GET THE A-Z OF THE VH </div></div></a><a href="/venue-hire" class="list_item green_bg desktop venue-hide w-inline-block"><div class="left_image_part"><img class="image_ht" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638eeed18ce65fdac37509d0/6391afa969905c9d93cadb29_viaduct-harbour-venue-hire.jpg" alt="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(max-width: 695px) 100vw, 695px" data-w-id="125e4d4d-492c-f51c-44a0-23bb33c616a3" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638eeed18ce65fdac37509d0/6391afa969905c9d93cadb29_viaduct-harbour-venue-hire-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638eeed18ce65fdac37509d0/6391afa969905c9d93cadb29_viaduct-harbour-venue-hire.jpg 695w"/></div><div class="right_collection_text"><h2 data-w-id="125e4d4d-492c-f51c-44a0-23bb33c616a5" style="opacity:0" class="text_heading green_text">VENUE HIRE</h2><div data-w-id="71c8ef98-e481-57e0-88ba-f03209a430c3" style="opacity:0" class="home_filter_button green_text">Viaduct Harbour has a number of venue hire spaces for your next event. From graduations to community events, Viaduct Harbour has an array of spaces for all event types.</div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="blog_div"><div class="inner_blog_div"><div class="flex-gap-16"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638eeed18ce65fdac37509d0/645b1b1a99ba341d2c183d7a_wheelchair-accessible.svg" loading="lazy" alt="ACCESSIBLE PLACES TO DINE"/><h3 data-w-id="94d61a08-a208-8160-6dba-c9590877430f" style="opacity:0" class="small_ttl">ACCESSIBLE PLACES TO DINE</h3></div><div class="blog_article"><div class="blog_list w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="blog_slider w-dyn-items"><div data-w-id="bb42b3b2-1188-2b2c-ebc3-ce18d8ebc034" style="opacity:0" role="listitem" class="blog_itm w-dyn-item"><div class="blog_inner_dv"><div class="blog_thumb mob-mb-32"><a href="/eat-and-drink/bivacco" class="blog_link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/65cd8a8ea4550dedf27482ac_FEATURED%20IMAGE.png" loading="lazy" alt="Bivacco" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/65cd8a8ea4550dedf27482ac_FEATURED%20IMAGE-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/65cd8a8ea4550dedf27482ac_FEATURED%20IMAGE.png 772w" class="blog_img"/></a></div><div class="blog_desc no_padding"><a href="/eat-and-drink/bivacco" class="link-block-2 w-inline-block"><h2 class="blog_ttl">Bivacco</h2></a><p class="blog_smry_desc">A bold, Italian restaurant serving simple, unfussy fare built from locally sourced ingredients. Bivacco is a destination for slow lunches, memorable dinners, after work drinks, and weekend feasts, with stunning views of the harbour.</p><a href="/eat-and-drink/bivacco" class="home_filter_button mob-top-0 w-button">read more</a></div></div></div><div data-w-id="bb42b3b2-1188-2b2c-ebc3-ce18d8ebc034" style="opacity:0" role="listitem" class="blog_itm w-dyn-item"><div class="blog_inner_dv"><div class="blog_thumb mob-mb-32"><a href="/eat-and-drink/esther" class="blog_link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/645c8b11db5f7f1e92d7350e_27.2%20(1).jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Esther" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/645c8b11db5f7f1e92d7350e_27.2%20(1)-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/645c8b11db5f7f1e92d7350e_27.2%20(1)-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/645c8b11db5f7f1e92d7350e_27.2%20(1)-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/645c8b11db5f7f1e92d7350e_27.2%20(1).jpg 1327w" class="blog_img"/></a></div><div class="blog_desc no_padding"><a href="/eat-and-drink/esther" class="link-block-2 w-inline-block"><h2 class="blog_ttl">Esther</h2></a><p class="blog_smry_desc">Esther brings a taste of the Mediterranean to the convivial ground floor of Auckland&#x27;s QT hotel. Under the guidance of executive chef Sean Connolly, Esther mixes simplicity and wonder from their inviting country-style kitchen. </p><a href="/eat-and-drink/esther" class="home_filter_button mob-top-0 w-button">read more</a></div></div></div><div data-w-id="bb42b3b2-1188-2b2c-ebc3-ce18d8ebc034" style="opacity:0" role="listitem" class="blog_itm w-dyn-item"><div class="blog_inner_dv"><div class="blog_thumb mob-mb-32"><a href="/eat-and-drink/hello-beasty" class="blog_link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/664568dcc94ee83d4c6f4b07_FEATURED%20IMAGE-4.png" loading="lazy" alt="Hello Beasty" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/664568dcc94ee83d4c6f4b07_FEATURED%20IMAGE-4-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/638f1d4699226a92629ed23e/664568dcc94ee83d4c6f4b07_FEATURED%20IMAGE-4.png 772w" class="blog_img"/></a></div><div class="blog_desc no_padding"><a href="/eat-and-drink/hello-beasty" class="link-block-2 w-inline-block"><h2 class="blog_ttl">Hello Beasty</h2></a><p class="blog_smry_desc">Offering a contemporary Asian-inspired menu that delivers bold flavour profiles with influences from Japan, Korea, and China, owners Stu and Emma Rogan have crafted an inimitable vibe that sees Hello Beasty booked up for weeks in advance.</p><a href="/eat-and-drink/hello-beasty" class="home_filter_button mob-top-0 w-button">read more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="blog_div t_20"><div class="inner_blog_div flex_dv"><div class="left_wrapper"><h3 data-w-id="d70127b9-609b-c1ef-af13-696f0ff8cdbc" style="opacity:0" class="small_ttl sticky_ttl">LATEST</h3></div><div class="right_side_div"><div class="blog